This is the code:

            # Tokenize everything in the body.
            lastw = ''
            for w in word_re.findall(text):
                n = len(w)
                # Make sure this range matches in tokenize_word().
                if 3 <= n <= 12:
                    if w[-1] == 's':
                        w = w[:-1]
                    yield w
                    if lastw:
                        yield lastw + w
                    lastw = w + ' '

                elif n >= 3:
                    lastw = ''
                    for t in tokenize_word(w):
                        yield t

where

    word_re = re.compile(r"[\w$\-\x80-\xff]+")

